		<grapheme>Shoftim</grapheme>
		<phoneme>ʃoʊfˈtim</phoneme>
		<alias>Hebrew שׁוֹפְטִים, noun, literally "judges": Parashat Shoftim is the 48th weekly reading portion of the Torah, spanning Devarim (Deuteronomy) 16:18 through 21:9.</alias>
	</lexeme>
  <lexeme lang="he">
    <grapheme>Shoshana</grapheme>
